            "end_line": 62,
            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Single-byte buffer: offset at last valid position leaves 0 available UnsynchronizedByteArrayInputStream oneAtEnd = newStream(one, 1); assertEquals(0, oneAtEnd.available());"
